exports[`development component gallery > shell-stub / en DOM snapshot 1`] = `"<div class="shell"><a class="skip" href="#desk-main">Skip to content</a><header class="top"><div class="brand"><span class="mark">KIX</span><div><p class="eyebrow">Commerce desk</p><h1>Box office</h1></div></div><p class="demo-mark" data-demo="synthetic">Synthetic demo data. Stub fixtures only: no real payment, no credit disbursement, no venue entry, no public service.</p><nav aria-label="Surfaces"><button type="button" class="nav-toggle" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="surface-menu">Menu</button><ul id="surface-menu" class="nav-menu" data-open="false"><li class="nav-group"><span id="nav-group-buyer" class="nav-group-label">Buyer</span><ul aria-labelledby="nav-group-buyer"><li><a href="/" data-discover="true">Box office</a></li><li><a aria-current="page" href="/buyer" data-discover="true">Buyer</a></li><li><a href="/discovery" data-discover="true">Discover</a></li><li><a href="/inventory" data-discover="true">Seats and GA</a></li><li><a href="/admission" data-discover="true">Admission</a></li><li><a href="/resale" data-discover="true">Resale</a></li><li><a href="/gift" data-discover="true">Gift</a></li><li><a href="/mobile" data-discover="true">Mobile shell</a></li><li><a href="/assistant" data-discover="true">Assistant</a></li></ul></li><li class="nav-group"><span id="nav-group-organizer" class="nav-group-label">Organizer</span><ul aria-labelledby="nav-group-organizer"><li><a href="/organizer" data-discover="true">Organizer</a></li><li><a href="/organizer/workspace" data-discover="true">Organizer workspace</a></li><li><a href="/merchant" data-discover="true">Merchant</a></li></ul></li><li class="nav-group"><span id="nav-group-finance" class="nav-group-label">Finance</span><ul aria-labelledby="nav-group-finance"><li><a href="/finance" data-discover="true">Finance</a></li><li><a href="/provider" data-discover="true">Provider journey</a></li></ul></li><li class="nav-group"><span id="nav-group-credit" class="nav-group-label">Credit</span><ul aria-labelledby="nav-group-credit"><li><a href="/credit" data-discover="true">Credit</a></li><li><a href="/credit/origination" data-discover="true">Credit origination</a></li><li><a href="/credit/servicing" data-discover="true">Credit servicing</a></li></ul></li><li class="nav-group"><span id="nav-group-marketing" class="nav-group-label">Marketing</span><ul aria-labelledby="nav-group-marketing"><li><a href="/marketing" data-discover="true">Marketing</a></li><li><a href="/marketing/journey" data-discover="true">Benefit journey</a></li></ul></li><li class="nav-group"><span id="nav-group-platform" class="nav-group-label">Platform</span><ul aria-labelledby="nav-group-platform"><li><a href="/platform" data-discover="true">Trading platform</a></li><li><a href="/marketplace-performance" data-discover="true">Marketplace bench</a></li><li><a href="/permissions" data-discover="true">Permissions</a></li><li><a href="/notifications" data-discover="true">Notifications</a></li><li><a href="/identity" data-discover="true">Journey context</a></li><li><a href="/session" data-discover="true">Session recovery</a></li></ul></li><li class="nav-group"><span id="nav-group-verification" class="nav-group-label">Verification</span><ul aria-labelledby="nav-group-verification"><li><a href="/receipts" data-discover="true">Receipts</a></li><li><a href="/handoff" data-discover="true">Local handoff</a></li><li><a href="/journeys" data-discover="true">Journeys</a></li><li><a href="/qualification" data-discover="true">Qualification</a></li><li><a href="/release" data-discover="true">Release</a></li><li><a href="/help" data-discover="true">Help</a></li><li><a href="/dev/gallery" data-discover="true">Component gallery</a></li></ul></li></ul></nav><div class="locale-switch" role="group" aria-label="Language"><span class="locale-label">Language</span><button type="button" lang="en" aria-pressed="true" data-locale="en">✓ English</button><button type="button" lang="ko" aria-pressed="false" data-locale="ko">한국어</button><span class="locale-status" role="status"></span></div><p class="help-line">The glossary explains every status word. UNKNOWN is not a failure and not a success. <a href="/help" data-discover="true">Help — status words</a> </p></header><div class="crumb-row"><nav aria-label="Breadcrumb"><ol class="crumbs"><li><span aria-current="page">Buyer</span></li></ol><p class="crumb-binding">Binding <strong>stub-only</strong></p></nav></div><p class="banner" role="status">Adapter <strong>stub</strong>. Environment <strong>stub</strong>. No live chain and no funds movement. Public production deployment is not selected. This desk renders a mock credit case and does not disburse to a bank. F04 and E06 stay 설계중. Protocol truth remains in kix-protocol.</p><p class="banner transport" role="status" data-transport-state="local" data-status-mark="local"><span class="status-word">Local.</span> Integration HTTP is not selected. A failed gate does not switch this desk, and HTTP mode does not fall back to the stub.</p><section class="first-run" aria-labelledby="first-run-title" data-first-run="shown"><p id="first-run-title" tabindex="-1"><strong>First visit: this desk runs on synthetic stub data</strong></p><p>Nothing shown is a real sale, payment, right or entry. Choose where to start, or skip this guide.</p><ul class="first-run-roles"><li><a data-role="buyer" href="/buyer" data-discover="true">Start as a buyer → Buyer workspace</a></li><li><a data-role="organizer" href="/organizer/workspace" data-discover="true">Start as an organizer → Organizer workspace</a></li><li><a data-role="operator" href="/receipts" data-discover="true">Start as an operator → Receipts</a></li></ul><button type="button" id="first-run-skip">Skip the guide</button><p><a href="/help" data-discover="true">Status words are explained on the help page.</a></p><p>Local run guide: docs/guide/local-run-ko.md</p></section><main id="desk-main" tabindex="-1"><h2>Synthetic Shell specimen</h2><p>UNKNOWN · NOT_BOUND · STALE · UNDETERMINED</p></main></div>"`;

exports[`development component gallery > shell-stub / ko DOM snapshot 1`] = `"<div class="shell"><a class="skip" href="#desk-main">본문으로 건너뛰기</a><header class="top"><div class="brand"><span class="mark">KIX</span><div><p class="eyebrow">커머스 데스크</p><h1>박스오피스</h1></div></div><p class="demo-mark" data-demo="synthetic">합성 데모 데이터입니다. stub fixture만 사용하며 실제 결제·여신 지급·현장 입장·공개 서비스는 없습니다.</p><nav aria-label="화면 목록"><button type="button" class="nav-toggle" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="surface-menu">메뉴</button><ul id="surface-menu" class="nav-menu" data-open="false"><li class="nav-group"><span id="nav-group-buyer" class="nav-group-label">구매자</span><ul aria-labelledby="nav-group-buyer"><li><a href="/" data-discover="true">박스오피스</a></li><li><a aria-current="page" href="/buyer" data-discover="true">구매자</a></li><li><a href="/discovery" data-discover="true">공연 찾기</a></li><li><a href="/inventory" data-discover="true">좌석과 입석</a></li><li><a href="/admission" data-discover="true">입장</a></li><li><a href="/resale" data-discover="true">재판매</a></li><li><a href="/gift" data-discover="true">선물</a></li><li><a href="/mobile" data-discover="true">모바일 셸</a></li><li><a href="/assistant" data-discover="true">어시스턴트</a></li></ul></li><li class="nav-group"><span id="nav-group-organizer" class="nav-group-label">주최자</span><ul aria-labelledby="nav-group-organizer"><li><a href="/organizer" data-discover="true">주최자</a></li><li><a href="/organizer/workspace" data-discover="true">주최자 작업공간</a></li><li><a href="/merchant" data-discover="true">판매자</a></li></ul></li><li class="nav-group"><span id="nav-group-finance" class="nav-group-label">재무</span><ul aria-labelledby="nav-group-finance"><li><a href="/finance" data-discover="true">재무</a></li><li><a href="/provider" data-discover="true">제공자 여정</a></li></ul></li><li class="nav-group"><span id="nav-group-credit" class="nav-group-label">크레딧</span><ul aria-labelledby="nav-group-credit"><li><a href="/credit" data-discover="true">크레딧</a></li><li><a href="/credit/origination" data-discover="true">크레딧 개설</a></li><li><a href="/credit/servicing" data-discover="true">크레딧 관리</a></li></ul></li><li class="nav-group"><span id="nav-group-marketing" class="nav-group-label">마케팅</span><ul aria-labelledby="nav-group-marketing"><li><a href="/marketing" data-discover="true">마케팅</a></li><li><a href="/marketing/journey" data-discover="true">혜택 여정</a></li></ul></li><li class="nav-group"><span id="nav-group-platform" class="nav-group-label">플랫폼</span><ul aria-labelledby="nav-group-platform"><li><a href="/platform" data-discover="true">거래 플랫폼</a></li><li><a href="/marketplace-performance" data-discover="true">마켓플레이스 측정</a></li><li><a href="/permissions" data-discover="true">권한</a></li><li><a href="/notifications" data-discover="true">알림</a></li><li><a href="/identity" data-discover="true">여정 맥락</a></li><li><a href="/session" data-discover="true">세션 복구</a></li></ul></li><li class="nav-group"><span id="nav-group-verification" class="nav-group-label">검증</span><ul aria-labelledby="nav-group-verification"><li><a href="/receipts" data-discover="true">영수증</a></li><li><a href="/handoff" data-discover="true">로컬 인계</a></li><li><a href="/journeys" data-discover="true">여정</a></li><li><a href="/qualification" data-discover="true">자격 검증</a></li><li><a href="/release" data-discover="true">릴리스</a></li><li><a href="/help" data-discover="true">도움말</a></li><li><a href="/dev/gallery" data-discover="true">컴포넌트 갤러리</a></li></ul></li></ul></nav><div class="locale-switch" role="group" aria-label="표시 언어"><span class="locale-label">표시 언어</span><button type="button" lang="en" aria-pressed="false" data-locale="en">English</button><button type="button" lang="ko" aria-pressed="true" data-locale="ko">✓ 한국어</button><span class="locale-status" role="status"></span><span class="locale-notice">한국어 표시는 일부 화면에만 적용됩니다. 화면 본문은 아직 영어일 수 있습니다.</span></div><p class="help-line">상태 단어 뜻은 도움말에 있습니다. UNKNOWN(결과 미확인)은 결과를 알 수 없다는 뜻입니다. <a href="/help" data-discover="true">도움말 — 상태 단어</a> </p></header><div class="crumb-row"><nav aria-label="현재 위치"><ol class="crumbs"><li><span aria-current="page">구매자</span></li></ol><p class="crumb-binding">연결 상태 <strong>stub-only</strong></p></nav></div><p class="banner" role="status">어댑터 <strong>stub</strong>. 환경 <strong>stub</strong>. 실제 체인과 자금 이동은 없습니다. 공개 프로덕션 배포는 선택되지 않았습니다. This desk renders a mock credit case and does not disburse to a bank. F04 and E06 stay 설계중. Protocol truth remains in kix-protocol.</p><p class="banner transport" role="status" data-transport-state="local" data-status-mark="local"><span class="status-word">로컬.</span> Integration HTTP는 선택되지 않았습니다. 게이트가 응답하지 않아도 이 데스크는 전환되지 않으며, HTTP 모드는 stub으로 되돌아가지 않습니다.</p><section class="first-run" aria-labelledby="first-run-title" data-first-run="shown"><p id="first-run-title" tabindex="-1"><strong>첫 방문 안내: 이 데스크는 합성 stub 데이터로 동작합니다</strong></p><p>표시된 내용은 실제 판매·결제·권리·입장이 아닙니다. 시작할 작업실을 선택하거나 안내를 건너뛰세요.</p><ul class="first-run-roles"><li><a data-role="buyer" href="/buyer" data-discover="true">구매자로 시작 → 구매자 작업실</a></li><li><a data-role="organizer" href="/organizer/workspace" data-discover="true">주최자로 시작 → 주최자 작업실</a></li><li><a data-role="operator" href="/receipts" data-discover="true">운영자로 시작 → 영수증</a></li></ul><button type="button" id="first-run-skip">안내 건너뛰기</button><p><a href="/help" data-discover="true">도움말에서 상태 단어의 뜻을 확인하세요.</a></p><p>로컬 실행 안내: docs/guide/local-run-ko.md</p></section><main id="desk-main" tabindex="-1"><h2>Synthetic Shell specimen</h2><p>UNKNOWN · NOT_BOUND · STALE · UNDETERMINED</p></main></div>"`;

